OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA band of heavy and thundery
OL,6,Frain will move slowly northwards
OL,7,Facross England and Wales, reaching
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland and southern Scotland
OL,9,Fduring the afternoon. Sunny spells
OL,10,Ffollowing but also some scattered
OL,11,Fshowers. Feeling warm and humid,
OL,12,Fespecially in the south.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRain will continue to move
OL,15,Fnorth across Scotland and also
OL,16,Fpersisting across northeast England.
OL,17,FVariable cloud and a few showers
OL,18,Felsewhere, with perhaps some
OL,19,Fthunderstorms towards the southeast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
