OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FBands of rain and showers
OL,6,Fmoving across many parts throughout
OL,7,FFriday, with most persistent rain
OL,8,Ftowards the northeast. Driest across
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland and perhaps southeast
OL,10,FEngland. Temperatures nearer average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
